9	{"name": "family_shape_audit", "directory": "harnesses/family_shape_audit", "hypothesis": "Deriving a question type as the complete opening sentence several references share - and looking it up anywhere in the text the memory receives, since at solve time that text is the whole task prompt - so that the pre-submit check reports the answer count of the question's own type and treats a count that type never uses as a defect, with the verdict affirming a draft only when the report has nothing to say about it, raises the mean validation score above the 0.573 of iteration 7 and the 0.584 of iteration 3, mainly by turning drafts whose count their own type never uses into drafts with that type's count (2 replayed free-form drafts, both wrong, in a type that answers with 2 parts in 100% while the draft had 3) and by no longer talking a correct draft out of a unit it had already added (1 replayed label draft whose gold answer was exactly the draft the old relation note rejected), without regressing the tasks that have no question type, where the profile, the references and the check report are unchanged.", "candidate_id": "1aa96069bc69cab0db6b5ca3bb55b2e558fb41226c5652b7f645361cad25b30b", "split": "val", "spec": {"limit": null, "samples": 2}, "scores": {"USPTO": {"accuracy": 0.2, "correct": 12, "total": 59, "num_examples": 30, "aggregation": "sample_mean", "avg_f1": null, "micro_f1": null, "failed_samples": 1, "model_calls": 172, "input_tokens": 1859244, "output_tokens": 358158, "status": "partial", "successful_accuracy": 0.2033898305084746, "successful_samples": 59, "expected_samples": 60, "completion_rate": 0.9833333333333333, "missing_samples": 0, "errors": [{"example_index": 8, "sample_index": 0, "type": "timeout", "message": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/opt/venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/httpx2/_transports/default.py\", line 98, in map_httpcore_exceptions\n    yield\n  File \"/opt/venv/lib/python3.11/site-packages/httpx2/_transports/default.py\", 